I come home.
I change my clothes.
I put on comfortable clothes.
I go into my kitchen.
The kitchen is very quiet.
I am making dinner now.
I turn on the stove.
I am heating oil in a pot.
I am cutting an onion and a tomato.
I put the onion in the hot oil.
I have a new spice box.
That box is made of steel.
I open my spice box.
There are different spices in it.
I am putting some spices in the vegetable dish.
The spices smell very nice.
My food is slowly getting ready.
I am feeling very peaceful in the kitchen.
I like this time a lot.
I am cooking happily.
